This rule will trigger an unlimited amount of time rearming every refreshes, each time it triggers it will do so on Every selection|so you will always have the most uptdate information||Everytime it triggers it will store a range of data from TPD into stored values (shared), because they are shared Stored Values this means any of the data can then be used by other rules or refrerenced in other areas of Bet Angel ie, displayed on your one-click screen, ladder screen Guardian etc||The two regular stored values it stores along with the Stored Value name are as follows|Position in race = 'runner_position'|Speed (m/s) = speed  (This also has an adjustment to covert the speed into mph before the value is stored)||The Speed (m/s) with the samde adjustment to covert to mph is also stored into the History List 1||There is then a further Stored Value derived from range calculations |This stores a value named 'average_speed_10secs' by averaging the values in History List 1 from the last 10secs
