1
True
S
ALERT

False
This rule will place a lay bet on ANY selection with a £10 liability stake providing that selection was an 'Ex- Leader' of the race but has now fallen back to 4th position or lower ||It can trigger up to three times but will never lay the same runner more than once||To do this it uses 4 conditions|A signal set condition to test the signal named 'led_race' (set by the previous rule) must be set on a selection - ie, its led the race at some point.|A Stored Value condition to test the selections stored value named 'runner_position' (ie, its position)|is equal to or greater than the selection rank 4 (ie, 4th position) in the custom ranking 1 list|The Stored Value named 'average_speed_10secs' for the selection needs to be equal to or less than the stored value named 'average_speed_10secs' for the runner rank 1 in the custom ranking 1 list - ie, the average speed of the selection in the last 10 secs must be =< the average speed to the selection currently in the lead|Place Bet Triggers condition to test the lay bet has not yet triggered on this selection||
