This 'Set/Modify' Stored Value rule is applied to Every selection, it is always armed and will trigger an unlimited amount of times re-armimng every refresh - so it will aloways be providing the most upto date information ||Each time it triggers it will store four values, all are (shared) Stored Values which means they can be displayed throughout other areas of Bet Angel for example the one-click screen, ladder screen, guardian etc|||The first of these stores the value of the speed in m/s with the name 'current_speed1'|The second stores the par speed (average speed) of the course at the selections current location with the name 'par_speed1'|The third stored value takes the 'current_speed1' stored value from above minus's the stored value name 'par_speed1' from above|to produce a third stored value named 'diifference_speed'|The fourth Stores the value of the the selections back price with the name ' back_price'|||||
