This rule will trigger an unlimited amount of time rearming every refreshes, each time it triggers it will do so on Every selection|so you will always have the most uptdate information||Everytime it triggers it will store six values (shared) from TPD, because they are (shared) Stored Values it means any of the values can then be used by other rules or displayed in other areas of Bet Angel ie, on your one-click screen, ladder screen Guardian etc||The first four stored values are as follows along with there names;|*Speed m/s = 'current_speed'|*Par Speed of Course at the Selections Location - 'par_speed'|Stride Frequency - 'current_stride'|Par Stride Freq of Course at this Selections Location- 'par_stride'||*Both the Speed and par speed stored values also have an adjustment to covert it into mph before the value is stored.||The fifth stored value is named 'difference_speed'|This value iis created by subtracting the stored value named 'current_speed' from the stored value named 'par_speed' ||The sixth stored value is named 'difference_stride'|This value iis created by subtracting the stored value named 'current_stride' from the stored value named 'par_stride' ||
